        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): send fresh final messages after previews",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- stop Discord partial-stream finals from editing the preview message in place\n- declare Discord `finalEdit` support as disabled while keeping normal fallback/preview cleanup support\n- update Discord monitor tests to expect fresh final delivery and draft cleanup\n\n## Why\n\nFixes regression reported in #99662. When a user navigates away during a long Discord turn, finalizing by editing the existing preview/progress message does not reliably trigger Discord's unread/channel highlight. Sending the completed final answer as a new message restores the normal Discord completion cue.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm test:extension discord -- extensions/discord/src/monitor/message-handler.process.test.ts extensions/discord/src/channel.message-adapter.test.ts`\n- `pnpm tsgo:extensions:test`\n",
